wavelets modern Fortran translation - provenance notice
=======================================================

Upstream package:
  Package: wavelets
  Version: 0.3-0.2
  Title: Functions for Computing Wavelet Filters, Wavelet Transforms and
         Multiresolution Analyses
  Author: Eric Aldrich <ealdrich@gmail.com>
  Maintainer: Eric Aldrich <ealdrich@gmail.com>
  Repository: CRAN
  Upstream license declaration: GPL (>= 2)
  Upstream publication date: 2020-02-17

This repository translates the computational portions of that package into
modern free-form Fortran. The numerical algorithms, filter coefficient tables,
phase-shift rules, boundary handling, and four original C transform kernels are
derived from the upstream sources retained under upstream/.

Plotting, printing, summaries, R object-system plumbing, and presentation-only
code are intentionally omitted. Retained upstream R/C snapshots are included
for attribution, provenance, and review of the translated computational paths.

The translation is not an official release of Eric Aldrich or CRAN. All
applicable upstream licensing, copyright interests, and attribution remain in
force. The translation and modifications are distributed under
GPL-2.0-or-later, consistent with the upstream GPL (>= 2) declaration.

No external BLAS/LAPACK/ARPACK implementation, rfortran compatibility source,
or other translated R-package dependency is copied or vendored into this
package. No such numerical dependency is needed by this translation.
